<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/14/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act comes into operation in a State on a date to be appointed by the State Authority, with the concurrence of the Minister, by notification in the State Gazette."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/14/eng@> .
