<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/14/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act comes into operation in the Federal Territory of Kuala Lumpur, the Federal Territory of Putrajaya and the Federal Territory of Labuan on a date to be appointed by the Minister responsible for the Federal Territory of Kuala Lumpur, the Federal Territory of Putrajaya and the Federal Territory of Labuan by notification in the Gazette. New section 20b"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/14/eng@> .
